8dbc6","title":"Yaraare-yaku no Akutoku Kojin-inchou ni Tensei Shita Ore, Main Heroine no Musume-tachi ni Suka rete Shimau","altTitle":"Reincarnated as the Villainous Orphanage Director Destined to Be Defeated, I Ended Up Being Loved by the Main Heroines’ Daughters","description":"Roik, a vile orphanage director who runs the orphanage solely for money, suddenly remembers that he is a reincarnated person! \n\nThis is the world of a game he played in his previous life, and a future awaits him in which he is ruined after being killed by Alice, one of the orphanage’s children, who seeks revenge against him— “I almost envy Roik for living however he pleased…” \n\nAfter dying in his previous life due to a friend’s betrayal, Roik decides that, since he’s a villain, he’ll live however he wants. However, for some reason, the children begin looking up to him as their Papa, and he ends up forming a deep bond with them as a family…?! \n\nA heartwarming fantasy where he is loved and adored by the daughters of the main heroines proudly begins!!","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Action","Comedy","Isekai","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/de98c0aa-9539-4e95-9975-c2974848dbc6/7fb75987-5979-4a31-8b05-e378c21b5361.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.61,"follows":11337,"listAt":"2026-10-21T07:08:19.348Z","chapters":[{"id":"ff4ec1bd-4317-419a-9318-dcf787c6097e","number":"3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T20:20:48+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ddf96ff6-7fc9-440e-9eba-26e98f19c310","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2026-10-07T13:36:29+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"4d384eeb-0aad-4463-9b17-62b45f4fcbda","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":43,"createdAt":"2026-09-26T18:23:28+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":3,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T1